<th id="S5.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="S5.T6.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text">✗</span></th>
<td id="S5.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">✓</td>
